===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fi|sv}} {{m|fi|Kiiruna}}, clipping of {{etyl|se|sv}} {{m|se|Gironvárris||ptarmigan mountain}}, a mining mountain near the city which it was named after when it was founded. Giron was Finnishized to {{m|fi|Kiiruna}}, which was Swedishized to {{m|sv|Kiruna}}.

